# Direct denominator-WD composition.
# Run: cargo run --release -- -strict -lang en -f examples/proof_nodes/atomic/by_builtin_strategy/ordered_difference_nonzero.lit
# Historical explicit proof:
# forall x R:
#     x>1
#     =>:
#         x-1>0
#         1/(x-1)=1/(x-1)
# Boundary: all original domains and premises are required.
forall x R:
    x>1
    =>:
        1/(x-1)=1/(x-1)
